      "value": "Photorealistic live-action NEWTECONS corporate film, SHOT S06_A. Every reference picture shows the SAME selected c07 logo-corrected handover ceremony still. Preserve the exact seven adult Vietnamese people, facial identities, positions, navy reflective vests, fine blue-white grid company shirts, white helmets with fastened chin straps, official NEWTECONS logos, department lettering, flowers, red-draped table and the banner reading LE BAN GIAO DU AN with its original Vietnamese diacritics. Preserve the approved image's natural daylight and realistic skin and cloth texture.\nThe site commander CHAR_05 Do Manh Thang is the central man handing the dark folder to the bespectacled investor in the dark suit on his right, as positioned in the anchor. He is the ONLY speaker. With composed pride and natural visible lip and jaw articulation timed to the supplied unchanged Vietnamese dialogue WAV, he says: \"Dự án đạt chất lượng và bàn giao đúng tiến độ. Cả Ban chỉ huy chúng ta xứng đáng được vinh danh!\" While addressing the investor and his colleagues, he completes the folder handover and a brief firm right-hand handshake. Keep the folder and the two men's hands spatially coherent. The investor listens with mouth closed. The surrounding colleagues listen and give restrained, small congratulatory applause; no one else speaks, laughs or mouths words. Professional satisfied expressions, no exaggerated cheering or raised arms.\nMedium-wide framing shows the ceremony and all seven people. A very slow subtle lateral dolly to the right, consistent perspective and continuous motion, no cuts, no zoom to a close-up, keep the speaker's face visible. Real human adult proportions, five fingers, natural motion blur. Keep existing logos and text stable; no invented lettering, no mirrored logos, no face swaps, no extra people, no cartoon, no plastic skin, no warped folder, no fused hands."
